{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02960","headline":"奉和圣制幸晋阳宫 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制幸晋阳宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隋季失天策，万方罹凶残。\n皇祖称义旗，三灵皆获安。\n圣期将申锡，王业成艰难。\n盗移未改命，历在终履端。\n彼汾惟帝乡，雄都信郁盘。\n一月朔巡狩，羣后陪清銮。\n霸迹在沛庭，旧仪覩汉官。\n唐风思何深？舜典敷更宽。\n户蒙枌榆复，邑争牛酒欢。\n缅惟翦商後，岂独微禹叹。\n三后既在天，万年斯不刊。\n尊祖实我皇，天文皆仰观。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}